title: Kenta_Hangout1
---
Kenta: Hey! You're in my seminar, right? The one who always looks half asleep. #mood:smile
Kenta: I'm collecting Osaka urban legends. Want to hear about the underpass by the river?
-> Sure.
    Kenta: People say if you walk through it at night, you hear bells. In summer. From the far side.
    Kenta: Nobody has walked all the way through. Too dark, they say. #mood:worried
    <<flag clue_kenta_bells>>
-> I don't believe in that stuff.
    Kenta: That's what everyone says before the bells. #mood:smile
Kenta: Come on, the claw machine owes me a rematch. #mood:smile
===
title: Kenta_Hangout2
---
Kenta: I went to the underpass last night. Got about ten steps in. #mood:worried
Kenta: Darkest place I've ever been. My phone light did nothing. #mood:worried
-> You should have brought a real light.
    Kenta: That's the thing. I did. I just... ran. #mood:worried
-> Did you hear the bells?
    Kenta: ...Don't make me answer that. #mood:worried
Kenta: Take this. It's my old bike light. Brighter than it looks.
<<give flashlight>>
Kenta: If you go, you tell me everything. Deal? #mood:smile
===
title: Kenta_Hangout3
---
Kenta: Real talk. My brother used to tell me these stories. He moved to Tokyo and stopped calling. #mood:worried
Kenta: Chasing legends is kind of how I talk to him now. Weird, huh.
-> Not weird.
    Kenta: Thanks. Don't tell anyone I said that. #mood:smile
-> You should call him.
    Kenta: ...Yeah. Maybe I will. #mood:worried
<<flag kenta_confided>>
Kenta: Anyway! Rematch. The claw machine fears me now. #mood:smile
===
title: Kenta_HangoutAgain
---
Kenta: You came! The claw machine has been waiting. #mood:smile
You win a stuffed penguin neither of you wanted.
===
